, with Bethel to the west and Ai to the east. There he built an altar to the Lord, and he called on the name of the Lord.","from":28},{"book":"NUM","chapter":32,"verse":3,"verseEnd":3,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"“Ataroth, Dibon, Jazer, Nimrah, Heshbon, Elealeh, Sebam, Nebo, and Beon,","from":29},{"book":"DEU","chapter":32,"verse":49,"verseEnd":49,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"“Go up into the Abarim Range to Mount Nebo, in the land of Moab across from Jericho, and view the land of Canaan, which I am giving to the Israelites as their own possession.","from":29},{"book":"JOS","chapter":7,"verse":2,"verseEnd":2,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"Meanwhile, Joshua sent men from Jericho to Ai, which is near Beth-aven to the east of Bethel, and told them, “Go up and spy out the land.” So the men went up and spied out Ai.","from":28},{"book":"JOS","chapter":8,"verse":9,"verseEnd":9,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"So Joshua sent them out, and they went to the place of ambush and lay in wait between Bethel and Ai, to the west of Ai. But Joshua spent that night among the people.","from":28},{"book":"JOS","chapter":8,"verse":17,"verseEnd":17,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"Not a man was left in Ai or Bethel who did not go out after Israel, leaving the city wide open while they pursued Israel.","from":28},{"book":"JOS","chapter":9,"verse":17,"verseEnd":17,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"So the Israelites set out and on the third day arrived at their cities—Gibeon, Chephirah, Beeroth, and Kiriath-jearim.","from":25},{"book":"JOS","chapter":18,"verse":24,"verseEnd":25,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"Chephar-ammoni, Ophni, and Geba—twelve cities, along with their villages. Gibeon, Ramah, Beeroth,","from":26}],"notes":[],"groups":[]},"36-42":{"people":[{"id":"jedaiah-h3048h","name":"Jedaiah","kind":"person","brief":"A priest","count":1,"firstVerse":36},{"id":"jeshua-h3442g","name":"Jeshua","kind":"person","brief":"Returned priest","count":1,"firstVerse":36},{"id":"immer-h0