ang":"h","inPassage":2,"uses":91},{"base":"H2410","lemma":"חֲטִיטָא","tr":"cha·ti·ta","gloss":"Hatita","lang":"h","inPassage":1,"uses":2},{"base":"H7630","lemma":"שֹׁבָ֑י","tr":"sho·vay","gloss":"Shobai","lang":"h","inPassage":1,"uses":2},{"base":"H7651","lemma":"שֶׁ֫בַע","tr":"she·va","gloss":"seven","lang":"h","inPassage":2,"uses":394},{"base":"H1938","lemma":"הוֹדַוְיָה","tr":"ho·dav·yah","gloss":"Hodaviah","lang":"h","inPassage":1,"uses":4},{"base":"H0333","lemma":"אָטֵר","tr":"a·ter","gloss":"Ater","lang":"h","inPassage":1,"uses":5}],"parallels":[],"crossrefs":[{"book":"1CH","chapter":9,"verse":12,"verseEnd":12,"votes":5,"source":"both","text":"Adaiah son of Jeroham, the son of Pashhur, the son of Malchijah; Maasai son of Adiel, the son of Jahzerah, the son of Meshullam, the son of Meshillemith, the son of Immer;","from":38},{"book":"1CH","chapter":6,"verse":39,"verseEnd":39,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"Hemanʼs kinsman was Asaph, who served at his right hand: Asaph the son of Berechiah, the son of Shimea,","from":41},{"book":"1CH","chapter":9,"verse":10,"verseEnd":10,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"From the priests: Jedaiah, Jehoiarib, and Jachin;","from":36},{"book":"1CH","chapter":15,"verse":17,"verseEnd":17,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"So the Levites appointed Heman son of Joel; from his brothers, Asaph son of Berechiah; from their brothers the Merarites, Ethan son of Kushaiah;","from":41},{"book":"1CH","chapter":24,"verse":7,"verseEnd":7,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"The first lot fell to Jehoiarib, the second to Jedaiah,","from":36},{"book":"1CH","chapter":24,"verse":8,"verseEnd":8,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"the third to Harim, the fourth to Seorim,","from":39},{"book":"1CH","chapter":24,"verse":14,"verseEnd":14,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"the fifteenth to Bilgah, the sixteenth to Immer,","from":37},{"book":"1CH","chapter":25,"verse":1,"verseEnd":2,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"Additionally, David and the commanders of the army set apart some of the sons of Asaph, Heman, and Jeduthun to prophesy with the accompaniment of lyres, harps, and cymbals. The following is the list of the men who performed this service: From the sons of Asaph: Zaccur, Joseph, Nethaniah, and Asarelah. These sons of Asaph were under the direction of Asaph, who prophesied under the direction of the king.","from":41}],"notes":[],"groups":[]},"43-58":{"people":[{"id":"hasupha-h2817","name":"Hasupha","kind":"person","brief":"Returned from exile","count":1,"firstVerse":43},{"id":"tabbaoth-h2884","name":"Tabbaoth","kind":"person","brief":"Returned from exile","count":1,"firstVerse":43},{"id":"ziha-h6727g","name":"Ziha","kind":"person","brief":"Returned from exile","count":1,"firstVerse":43},{"id":"keros-h7026","name":"Keros","kind":"person","brief":"Returned from exile","count":1,"firstVerse":44},{"id":"padon-h6303","name":"Padon","kind":"person","brief":"Returned from exile","count":1,"firstVerse":44},{"id":"siaha-h5517","name":"Siaha","kind":"person","brief":"Returned from exile","count":1,"firstVerse":44},{"id":"akkub-h6126i","name":"Akkub","kind":"person","brief":"Returned from exile","count":1,"firstVerse":45},{"id":"hagabah-h2286b","name":"Hagabah","kind":"person","brief":"Returned from exile","count":1,"firstVerse":45},{"id":"lebanah-h3838","name":"Lebanah","kind":"person","brief":"","count":1,"firstVerse":45},{"id":"hagab-h2285","name":"Hagab","kind":"person","brief":"Returned from exile","count":1,"firstVerse":46},{"id":"hanan-h2605j","name":"Hanan","kind":"person","brief":"Returned from exile","count":1,"firstVerse":46},{"id":"shalmai-h8014","name":"Shalmai","kind":"person","brief":"Returned from exile","count":1,"firstVerse":46},{"id":"gahar-h1515","name":"Gahar","kind":"person","brief":"Returned from exile","count":1,"firstVerse":47},{"id":"giddel-h1435g","name":"Giddel","kind":"person","brief":"Returned from exile","count":1,"firstVerse":47},{"id":"reaiah-h7211h","name":"Reaiah","kind":"person","brief":"Returned